 d with regular schedules Monday\, October 12. The closure and reopening an
 nouncements did not specify a make-up date.\nSource: https://www.jcsb.org/
 index.php?articleID=91704531&pageID=smartSiteFeed&psqFeed=true\nNote sourc
 es: https://www.jcsb.org/index.php?articleID=92175739&pageID=smartSiteFeed
